    "notes": [
      "This corpus is the authoritative relink-compatibility case list for original-object verification.",
      "Phase 6 seeds startup-object, ordinary dynamic, PIE, static, static-PIE, and GLIBC_PRIVATE coverage.",
      "Phase 7 extends the corpus with network-facing libanl, libresolv, and libnss module coverage while keeping the preserved original-object workflow intact.",
