      "Later phases must extend this file in place instead of rediscovering cases from work/original-build ad hoc.",
      "Phase 9 extends the corpus with libdl, libm, librt, and libutil coverage while keeping the preserved original-object workflow intact.",
      "Phase 10 completes final libc6-dev startfile provenance coverage, including Mcrt1.o, Scrt1.o, gcrt1.o, grcrt1.o, and rcrt1.o profiling/static-PIE variants."
    ]
